hat again with  our International Partners we seized the  Tango a super yacht owned by Victor  vexelberg another sanctioned oligarch  with close ties to the Russian regime  on that same day we obtained seizure  warrants targeting the assets of several  additional sanctioned Russian Nationals  the justice department will continue to  work alongside our International  Partners to hold accountable those who  break our laws  threaten our national security and harm  our allies  in the last half an hour President Biden  has tweeted quote I may clear that  Russia would pay a severe and immediate  price for its atrocities in butcher  today along with our allies and partners  we're announcing a new round of  devastating sanctions
 

